# External Media Generation & FFmpeg Processing Backend (see /backend/README.md)
# Leave these as UNCONFIGURED for Preview Mode: local Room projects, Gemini AI Lyrics Studio,
# ML Kit Face Detection, Audio Waveform Editor, and Raven & Breeze Duet drafts work locally without them.
# After deploying /backend on Render Free Tier, set both values in the AI Studio Secrets panel:
STUDIO_BACKEND_BASE_URL=UNCONFIGURED
STUDIO_BACKEND_API_KEY=UNCONFIGURED
